OL,3,GNEWSAAI porn deepfakes put women off
OL,4,Apublic life, MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAI porn deepfakes could make women less
OL,7,Flikely to want to enter politics, an MP
OL,8,Fwhose name and image were used to
OL,9,Fcreate content has said.
OL,11,FMims Davies, the shadow Welsh
OL,12,FSecretary, said she received an email
OL,13,Fin her parliamentary inbox which said
OL,14,F"her likeness was found on forums in
OL,15,Fabusive and pornographic content".
OL,17,FThe Conservative frontbencher said
OL,18,Fthose making money from deepfakes was
OL,19,F"grotesque", urging people to report it
OL,20,Fif it happens to them so that "culprits
OL,21,Fcan be held to account".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
